# Firebase config for project carevo-pos. Holds the Android API key, which is
# currently unrestricted — it authorises billable phone-auth SMS from any origin,
# not just this app — and this repo is public. Same posture as maps.properties.
# Fetch per machine: Firebase console -> Project settings -> Your apps ->
# com.carevo.customer_app -> google-services.json, into android/app/.
# The Gradle google-services plugin fails the build if it is missing.
/app/google-services.json
